\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The REIGN end-to-end causal discovery pipeline. Raw multivariate time series $\mathbf  {X}$ passes sequentially through robust preprocessing (Stage 1), PELT-based regime segmentation (Stage 2a), LLM prior injection (Stage 2b), per-regime MPGNN training (Stage 3), and confidence-weighted ensemble aggregation (Stage 4) to produce the final DAG $\mathcal  {G}^*$.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{4}{The REIGN end-to-end causal discovery pipeline. Raw multivariate time series $\mathbf {X}$ passes sequentially through robust preprocessing (Stage 1), PELT-based regime segmentation (Stage 2a), LLM prior injection (Stage 2b), per-regime MPGNN training (Stage 3), and confidence-weighted ensemble aggregation (Stage 4) to produce the final DAG $\mathcal {G}^*$}{figure.1}{}}
